[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the two sections of the vacuum pipe from the valve.</p><p>2. Remove the one-way valve.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034963.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the one-way valve, connecting it to\nthe vacuum pipe.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p>"]]